- Apply an optional discount.
- Select payment status: paid, partially paid, or unpaid.
- Select payment method: cash, EFT, card, or other.
- Record a transaction date.
- Add an optional customer.
- Add an optional note.
- Save the transaction.
- View a transaction receipt or summary.
- Edit or void a transaction with a recorded reason and appropriate permissions.
