- View sale details.
- Export a CSV of permitted sales records.

Calculate totals automatically and validate quantities and prices.

When a sale includes tracked inventory, decrease stock appropriately. Avoid deducting inventory twice if a sale is edited.

Record changes in an audit trail.

Support appropriate payment-status changes without treating an unpaid invoice as cash already received.

